  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN - Programme support 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN was founded in 1948 as the worlds largest voluntary environment organizations with now over 1100 public and private sector memberorganisations and 10.000 + voluntary experts from 181 countries attached. IUCN support the global agenda on sustainable use of natural resources with special consideration to eradication of poverty. In preoaration of the Post 2015 development goals the IUCN is playing a crucial role as a science based reference to policy formulation.
Denmark has supported IUCN since 1991 and is in addition to supporting the global program working with IUCN on spcific issues like foresty (REDD+) and Mangroves.</narrative>
  </description>
